12
00:01:06.747 --> 00:01:09.007
You’re coding a city-builder game.

13
00:01:09.007 --> 00:01:11.907
A table: x, y, speed, type.

14
00:01:11.907 --> 00:01:14.267
Every frame, one big loop:

15
00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:16.367
if it’s a car, drive the lane;

16
00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:18.487
if it’s a bus, stop at the stop;

17
00:01:18.487 --> 00:01:20.347
