26
00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:46.846
(narrator) Verse 1, from record to object.

27
00:01:46.846 --> 00:01:50.179
(narrator) A record card for Car holds only fields: x, y, and speed.

28
00:01:50.179 --> 00:01:57.722
