33
00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:24.960
♪ Sixty-six: Tony Hoare’s record. ♪

34
00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:27.180
♪ A car was just fields: x, y, speed. ♪

35
00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:30.000
