54
00:03:22.767 --> 00:03:23.361
(narrator) The chorus.

55
00:03:23.361 --> 00:03:27.356
(narrator) The town on the left is the world; object cards on the right are the code.

56
00:03:27.356 --> 00:03:29.354
(narrator) One card's state padlock clicks shut.

57
00:03:29.354 --> 00:03:34.376
