59
00:03:39.073 --> 00:03:46.147
(narrator) A bubble asking what type are you is swiped away, and a rule card lists: state and code inside, send a message, the object decides.

60
00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:48.720
♪ Simulate the world in objects, ♪

61
00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.940
♪ state and code locked up inside. ♪

62
00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.780
♪ Don’t reach in: send a message, ♪

63
00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:56.260
♪ and let the object decide. ♪

64
