♪ Same message, different moves! ♪

65
00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.640
♪ Don’t ask, “What type are you?” ♪

66
00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:05.067
♪ Let the object decide! ♪

67
00:04:05.367 --> 00:04:17.871
